      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能亲眼见证她成为世界第一，\n见证『DREAMS』的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb18f409d3b2a2b2ecde28e8ef4cce1e53d1de99f8d0db7c820b48c91d57997",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
